{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"有\",\n      \"sec\": \"S02、S07\",\n      \"why\": \"S02明确写出亲近变得可亲、可留恋之后，珍惜和不舍才随之产生；S07又说明反复体验这种美好会使珍惜加深，从而让人更不愿亲近结束，构成了满足生出延续愿望的因果过程。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"有\",\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"why\": \"S12明确区分了感受更深与控制结果：越投入越能感到这一刻留不住，自己可以加深体验，却不能让时间停止，也不能替对方决定心意。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"有\",\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"why\": \"S14明确说明极限之后的松脱首先是身体反应，而不是问题得到解答；身体放松后留下的仍只是对这个人重要性的认识，并没有获得对方心意的答案。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"部分\",\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"why\": \"S14写到强烈冲动退去后，早先的温柔和舍不得重新浮现，但没有说明独自回味本身为什么仍能带来快乐，也没有明确写出回味并未消除想亲近的愿望。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"invented\": [],\n  \"loops\": [\n    \"S04–S06：先把追问对方是否知道自己的心意写成无效，再转向抽离、不抓紧，最后改用轻快主动的方式靠近；这是一串连续的应对策略更替，但文本没有充分交代每一步为何必然由前一步的失败引出。\",\n    \"S12–S14：先试图更深地活在当下，却发现无法留住时间；随后又继续硬撑、集中力量承受，直到达到极限才停止追赶和挽留。这把情绪强度的起落组织成了连续的应对策略链，其中部分策略更替缺乏独立的因果依据。\"\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "74883701-86c3-4002-babd-c843515f3587", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T130533473019Z", "elapsed_seconds": 507.375, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:14:00.871304+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5c12f8bfc69a94315183130c44694be817d9acf8cc53b678fa11137c44a6c2ac", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T130533473019Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "a437cbe71d2e8897fca38026becdf1e76ba5cd94efea5c8dc18d5e36d7b7cdd3"}}}
